e stays resilient to cloud failures\",\"width\":260,\"height\":146,\"priority\":false,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw\",\"aria-hidden\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex min-w-0 mr-auto max-w-[684px] basis-[58%] pr-20 lt:max-w-none lt:pr-8 lg:pr-0 md:w-full md:basis-auto w-[424px]! shrink-0 flex-col-reverse 2xl:w-auto! 2xl:min-w-0 2xl:shrink 2xl:pr-0! md:w-full! md:gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 flex gap-2 font-mono text-[13px] leading-none tracking-extra-tight mt-auto mb-0!\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium uppercase text-blue-70\",\"to\":\"/blog/category/engineering\",\"children\":\"Engineering\"}],[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"className\":\"relative block shrink-0 leading-none tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-50 uppercase pl-4 before:absolute before:top-1/3 before:left-[3px] before:inline-block before:size-[3px] before:rounded-full before:bg-gray-new-30\",\"dateTime\":\"2026-05-27T12:00:00\",\"children\":\"May 27, 2026\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"className\":\"group flex flex-col mt-0\",\"to\":\"/blog/resilience-to-failures-in-agentic-era\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"tracking-tighter transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-gray-new-80 line-clamp-3 text-2xl leading-tight md:text-[20px] sm:text-lg\",\"children\":\"How Neon's lakebase architecture stays resilient to cloud failures\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"61:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"So, \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"how do we manage to provide a unique database copy instantaneously every time a user follows the demo?\"}],\" It’s because all other “copies” that users create are child branches derived from this main branch.\"]}]\n62:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"When you click \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Copy\"}],\" in the demo, you’re actually creating a Neon branch under the hood:\"]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L60\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxdfxj3tljatqjt6lxfwjqgqmdbvkzv9y8kmf8uq75hhhstqfg2ghx1bstukzon3i4fa6m1nlodjfoho3xc938ehnaizdmhpfzoa-xvgczi0i6ebgxkcjho4pwgcmusshgvhg-7fcac78d.png\",\"isDark\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxdfxj3tljatqjt6lxfwjqgqmdbvkzv9y8kmf8uq75hhhstqfg2ghx1bstukzon3i4fa6m1nlodjfoho3xc938ehnaizdmhpfzoa-xvgczi0i6ebgxkcjho4pwgcmusshgvhg-7fcac78d.png\",\"alt\":\"Image\"}]}]}]\n64:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Thanks to the magic of copy-on-write, Neon branches are incredibly agile and can be treated as ephemeral. When you create a branch, Neon doesn’t have to load the entire dataset again. Instead, it references the same data pages as the parent environment (\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/blog/get-page-at-lsn\",\"children\":\"read about Neon’s storage design\"}],\").\"]}]\n65:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Since branches are ready instantly, even for very large datasets (in fact, the size of the dataset has no impact at all) they can be created for a specific purpose—a development task, a test run, a Vercel preview, this demo—and deleted once the task is done.\"}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"At the same time, they are completely isolated from their parent. When you start modifying records on them, Neon begins writing new pages for the changed data, which is what we were demonstrating here:\"}]\n67:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L60\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxct6slzz69odjussyamyvgeufbp7fopi4sborj1ytxrx7xaqenfgx4yoakoqbt6ridjsyezdvo9u60jib7wmzgdmu15njyuzs7sndjoju-ftusrilyarrjjxn0voy3dlidevkkq-d312672d.png\",\"isDark\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxct6slzz69odjussyamyvgeufbp7fopi4sborj1ytxrx7xaqenfgx4yoakoqbt6ridjsyezdvo9u60jib7wmzgdmu15njyuzs7sndjoju-ftusrilyarrjjxn0voy3dlidevkkq-d312672d.png\",\"alt\":\"Image\"}]}]}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Copy-on-write also enables Neon to do some very cool things. For example, branches can be reset to match the parent environment instantaneously. This is what you experience during the demo, when you accidentally modify something and then revert it with just one click:\"}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L60\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxeyvb8fafunfdo06znogxonjp7p39rjb86cyb1vanvtlihacrtzg2dcqjnzwgliwmusjzsqgwiqlprhk4ebyoxmtjjgmzwbotca9xhp-pti34wdtxopg4izd4eloggssjot-1057bbbf.png\",\"isDark\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxeyvb8fafunfdo06znogxonjp7p39rjb86cyb1vanvtlihacrtzg2dcqjnzwgliwmusjzsqgwiqlprhk4ebyoxmtjjgmzwbotca9xhp-pti34wdtxopg4izd4eloggssjot-1057bbbf.png\",\"alt\":\"Image\"}]}]}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L60\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-copy-on-write/ad4nxdea1zivo6pykv9r8kyawhzcaprikwn4ye50790eno8-jfwbakodbinkxlrsayo1ige3ch8i6qdcm1tyevrlqdax2apcztdlawaz9s2qgboqh7xt-utd0yksni3jx8awrmq6m-1b46111f.png\",\"isDark\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://cdn.neonapi.io/public/images/pages/blog/instantly-copy-tb-size-datasets-the-magic-of-c"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"opy-on-write/ad4nxdea1zivo6pykv9r8kyawhzcaprikwn4ye50790eno8-jfwbakodbinkxlrsayo1ige3ch8i6qdcm1tyevrlqdax2apcztdlawaz9s2qgboqh7xt-utd0yksni3jx8awrmq6m-1b46111f.png\",\"alt\":\"Image\"}]}]}]}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"from-demo-to-use-case\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"From demo to use case\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#from-demo-to-use-case\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to From demo to use case\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$57:16:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"You may still be thinking, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"this is flashy for a demo—but how can I benefit from it?\"}],\" As we said at the start of this post, branching is probably the most loved Neon feature by our users:\"]}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"“We’re a small team, but we’re scaling quickly and doing a lot. We’re shipping multiple times a day—to do that, we need to test stuff quickly and merge to main very quickly as well. Neon branches are a game changer for this” (Avi Romanoff, Founder at \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://magiccircle.studio\",\"children\":\"Magic Circle\"}],\" – \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/blog/how-magic-circle-scaled-up-to-2m-games-with-cloudfare-and-neon\",\"children\":\"Read more\"}],\")\"]}]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"“Branching saves us both money and developer time. We no longer have to set up an actual testing database instance and make sure the data is always synced with production. We now spin up an ephemeral branch when we need to and then tear it down via the create/delete Github Actions” (Angelina Quach, Software Engineer at \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://shepherdinsurance.com\",\"children\":\"Shepherd\"}],\" – \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/blog/adopting-neon-branching-in-ci-cd-pipelines-a-practical-story-by-shepherd\",\"children\":\"Read more\"}],\")\"]}]}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"blockquote\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"“Database branching is the best quality-of-life improvement to my tech stack that I can think of in recent years. Second to maybe only Copilot” (Miguel Hernandez, Backend Tech Lead at Neo.Tax – \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/blog/from-days-to-minutes-how-neo-tax-accelerated-their-development-lifecycle\",\"children\":\"Read more\"}],\")\"]}]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Once you’ve experimented with branches and understand the basics of how they work, it gets easier to appreciate their potential. Here are the most popular use cases among our user base:\"}]\n71:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Ephemeral dev/test environments\"}],\". If you sync a testing dataset into a Neon main branch, you can use branches to create as many ephemeral environments as you need for development and testing. Each branch serves as a clean, independent workspace. When it’s time to resync the environments, you do it with a single click or an API call. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/use-cases/dev-test\",\"children\":\"Read more.\"}]]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Previews.\"}],\" You can also use Neon branches to automatically create a preview environment for each pull request, e.g. via Vercel. Each preview branch mirrors the same state as production at the time it was created. When the pull request is closed, you delete the branch. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/guides/vercel-previews-integration\",\"children\":\"This guide\"}],\" explains how to set this up"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," with Vercel.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Local development.\"}],\" On a team, every engineer can have their own Neon branch as a personal development environment, preloaded with a realistic dataset.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n72:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"not-all-branching-is-the-same\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Not all branching is the same\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#not-all-branching-is-the-same\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Not all branching is the same\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$57:16:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Neon is not the only database that offers a “branching” feature, but not all branches are created equal. We like to distinguish between three types of branching:\"}]\n74:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"id\":\"schema-only-branching\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Schema-only branching\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#schema-only-branching\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Schema-only branching\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3\",\"children\":\"$57:16:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Schema-only branching means you start with your original database, and when you branch it, you clone only the schema or table structure and definitions. You do not include the data in the branch.\"}]\n76:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For example, if we had to create this database:\"}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"With this information:\"}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"After branching it with a schema-only implementation, it would show this:\"}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Only the table definitions exist, but the data has not been brought into the branch with it. This is the implementation of branching that \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://supabase.com/docs/guides/deployment/branching\",\"children\":\"Supabase\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://planetscale.com/docs/concepts/branching\",\"children\":\"Planetscale\"}],\" offer (Planetscale has a separate Data Branching feature that we’ll discuss in a minute).\"]}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Branching schemas can be useful for some very specific use cases (\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://neon.tech/docs/introduction/roadmap\",\"children\":\"which is why we’re planning to offer this in Neon soon\"}],\") but for most workflows, schema-only branching has a massive trade-off: \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"it still requires loading a dataset into every branch.\"}],\" If you wanted to implement this type of branching for your dev/test